### =========================================================================
### EWMS - SPRINT 7: LEAVE MANAGEMENT SUITE LOCAL REST SIMULATION
### =========================================================================
@server = http://localhost:4004
@service = odata/v4/leave

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 1: LEAVE TYPES CONFIGURATION (MASTER DIRECTORY)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Read All Available Leave Types
GET {{server}}/{{service}}/LeaveTypes
Authorization: Basic admin:

### 1.2 Create New Leave Type - Casual Leave (Triggers Auto-Code SH/LV Matrix)
# @name createLeaveTypeCL
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeaveTypes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "name": "Marriage Leave",
    "description": "Special paid time off allocation for marital lifecycle events.",
    "color": "purple",
    "isPaid": true,
    "carryForward": false,
    "requiresDocument": true,
    "maxDaysPerRequest": 5,
    "status": "Active"
}

### 1.3 Create New Leave Type - Sick Leave (Mandates Attachments for Block extensions)
# @name createLeaveTypeSL
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeavePolicies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "company_ID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "businessUnit_ID": "bbbbbbbb-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", 
    "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "daysPerYear": 18.00, 
    "carryForwardLimit": 2.00,
    "maxContinuousDays": 5.00,
    "minNoticeDays": 3,
    "status": "Active"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 2: LEAVE POLICIES MANAGEMENT
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Read All Active Leave Policies
GET {{server}}/{{service}}/LeavePolicies
Authorization: Basic admin:

### 2.2 Create Governance Policy Rule for Casual Leave Allocation
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeavePolicies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "company_ID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "businessUnit_ID": "cccccccc-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", 
    "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "daysPerYear": 14.00, 
    "carryForwardLimit": 0.00,
    "maxContinuousDays": 14.00,
    "minNoticeDays": 0,
    "status": "Active"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 3: ACCOUNT ENTITLEMENT LEDGERS (LEAVE BALANCES)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Read Active Employee Leave Balances
GET {{server}}/{{service}}/LeaveBalances
Authorization: Basic admin:

### 3.2 Initialize Balance Container Ledger for Employee 01 (John Doe)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeaveBalances
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", 
    "year": 2027,
    "allocatedDays": 15.00
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 4: LEAVE REQUEST PIPELINE TRANSACTION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Submit New Leave Request Application (Triggers Day Count & Overlap Blocks)
# @name submitLeaveRequest
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeaveRequests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "fromDate": "2026-10-20",
    "toDate": "2026-10-22",
    "reason": "Family relocation arrangements.",
    "halfDay": false,
    "emergencyLeave": false,
    "status": "Pending"
}


### 4.2 Test Defensive Overlap Block (Attempting Same Date Range Insertion)
POST {{server}}/{{service}}/LeaveRequests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "fromDate": "2026-08-18",
    "toDate": "2026-08-19",
    "reason": "Conflicting overlap request timeline entry test case scenario.",
    "halfDay": false,
    "status": "Pending"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 5: WORKFLOW MATRIX (LEAVE APPROVAL PROCESS)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Initialize Approval Target Step Node Row Reference (Simulated by Workflow Router)
# @name createApprovalStep
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave/LeaveApprovals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "leaveRequest_ID": "7d000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "approver_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
    "level": 1,
    "decision": "Pending"
}

### 5.2 Execute Manager Approval Sign-Off (Deducts Pending Register -> Increments Used)
PATCH {{server}}/{{service}}/LeaveApprovals(ID=7e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003)
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin:

{
    "decision": "Approved",
    "remarks": "Operational coverage verified. Request approved for the specified timeline."
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 6: IMMUTABLE AUDIT LOG & RECONCILIATION VERIFICATION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 View Historical Audit Trails (Strict Read-Only Constraint Enforced)
GET {{server}}/{{service}}/ApprovalHistories
Authorization: Basic admin:

### 6.2 Verify Defensive Deletion Block on Audit Log Rows (Expected Error: 400)
DELETE {{server}}/{{service}}/ApprovalHistories(ID=7f000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)
Authorization: Basic admin: